{"c":[{"id":"31075c4daaf75233","sum":"1.5.4, no vss: INSERT/DELETE fails on HNSW (unknown index type), even no-match; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop before writes (2026-10-22). No orphan guard: per-statement commits can leave orphans until next ingest or embed; top-k may be short, never an error.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T131311Z-ed378e2bb230c4e6","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 without vss on a file with the HNSW index: every INSERT or DELETE on embeddings fails (Cannot bind index, unknown index type HNSW), even a no-match delete; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop the index before any write. Measured 2026-10-22.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T134653Z-aa09ea6b143ae13d","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: exact semantic search has no orphan guard. write_session commits each statement separately, so an ingest crash can leave orphan embeddings until the next ingest or embed; a top-k search may then be short, never an error.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"584c14263b4266e5","sum":"Identical vectors are common (150 at distance 0), so exact search breaks top-k ties by harness, then id. SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse DuckDB query stdout. 2.0.0 embed/semantic leaks nanobind at exit: the Hub filter pins stockroom.embed; remove it after model load.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T175949Z-e9f28fbf7dbe5041","text":"2026-10-22: live data has many identical vectors (one query: 150 owners at distance 0), so top-k ties at the cut are common; exact semantic breaks them by harness, then id. DuckDB Python draws a progress bar on stdout for long queries; SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T183706Z-584e9a2f3117f291","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 nanobind 'leaked instances' at exit of embed/semantic: stockroom's own HF Hub logger filter (_DropUnauthenticatedHubWarning) stays on the logger for the process; its class pins stockroom.embed globals, so duckdb. Removing it after model load: no warning (2026-10-22).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
